Exceptions. These files keep their own licenses:

- beagle-linux/kernel/pru_rproc/: GPL-2.0-only. It is a patched copy of the
  Linux pru_rproc driver from Texas Instruments; see the SPDX headers.
- yocto/layers/meta-pb2/recipes-support/bb-usb-gadgets/bb-usb-gadgets/: MIT,
  Copyright (c) 2015 Robert Nelson; see the copyright file there.
- yocto/layers/meta-pb2/patches/: a patch to BitBake, GPL-2.0-only like
  BitBake itself.
- pru/pru0/AM62x_PRU0.cmd and pru/pru1/AM62x_PRU1.cmd: BSD-3-Clause,
  Copyright (C) Texas Instruments; see the header in each file.
- zephyr/erpc/shim/: generated by erpcgen from zephyr/erpc/pb2.erpc.

Code fetched at build time (EmbeddedRPC, the TI PRU Software Support Package,
BeagleBoard-DeviceTrees, Zephyr, and the TI PRU compiler) is not part of this
repository and keeps its own license.
